sequenceDiagram
    participant Repo
    participant RC as reliableCall
    participant CB as CircuitBreaker
    participant SAC as safeApiCall
    participant BK as Backend
    Repo->>RC: reliableCall(policy) - api.search(q)
    RC->>CB: canRequest(host)?
    CB-->>RC: yes (Closed)
    RC->>SAC: attempt 1
    SAC->>BK: GET
    BK-->>SAC: 503
    SAC-->>RC: Failure(Http 503) retryable
    RC->>CB: recordFailure
    RC->>RC: wait backoff(1) + jitter
    RC->>SAC: attempt 2
    SAC->>BK: GET
    BK-->>SAC: 200
    SAC-->>RC: Success
    RC->>CB: recordSuccess (reset)
    RC-->>Repo: Outcome.Success
